# Available Skill Triggers

Use these skills when the current task matches their scope and the skill is
available in the active environment. If a skill is unavailable, continue with the
best local fallback and mention the limitation.

## Reviews

- `$sdd-openspec-multiagent`: required SDD/OpenSpec and multi-agent workflow before project changes.
- `$openspec-explore`: inspect current OpenSpec project state and active changes.
- `$openspec-propose`: create proposal/design/spec/tasks for a new change.
- `$openspec-apply-change`: implement tasks from an active OpenSpec change.
- `$openspec-sync-specs`: sync completed change specs into canonical specs.
- `$openspec-archive-change`: archive completed OpenSpec changes.
- `$build-graph`: build/update code graph before reviews.
- `$review-delta`: review local diffs.
- `$review-pr`: review PR or branch diffs.

